  "item_short_desc": "<p>Conquer the cold with Rothco's Fishtail Parka, a perfect blend of style and functionality. Crafted from 100% cotton, this parka boasts a polyester button-in liner for added warmth, ensuring you stay comfortable in chilly weather. The snap-up back flap adds a unique touch while providing ventilation when needed. The brass zipper with a snap-up storm flap offers enhanced protection against the elements. Enjoy a customizable fit with the drawstring hood, waist, bottom, and adjustable wrist cuffs.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5054",
  "description": "<p>Conquer the cold with Rothco's Fishtail Parka, a perfect blend of style and functionality. Crafted from 100% cotton, this parka boasts a polyester button-in liner for added warmth, ensuring you stay comfortable in chilly weather. The snap-up back flap adds a unique touch while providing ventilation when needed. The brass zipper with a snap-up storm flap offers enhanced protection against the elements. Enjoy a customizable fit with the drawstring hood, waist, bottom, and adjustable wrist cuffs. Classic service-style button-down epaulets add a timeless touch, and the 2 front flap pockets provide secure storage for small essential gear.</p>",
